																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"689773669992366224","clan_steamid":"103582791475789488","event_name":"Mosaique Neko Waifus 6 is out now! \ud83d\udc31","event_type":28,"appid":4873800,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1794148440,"rtime32_end_time":1794150720,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",null,\"\",\"\"],\"localized_summary\":[\"Hello, Neko Connoisseurs!\",\"Hallo, Neko-Fans!\",\"Bonjour, chers amateurs de nekos !\",\"Ciao, intenditori di neko!\",\"\ub124\ucf54 \uc560\ud638\uac00 \uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84, \uc548\ub155\ud558\uc138\uc694!\",\"\u00a1Hola, amantes de las neko!\",\"\u5404\u4f4d\u732b\u5a18\u7231\u597d\u8005\uff0c\u5927\u5bb6\u597d\uff01\",\"\u5404\u4f4d\u8c93\u5a18\u611b\u597d\u8005\uff0c\u5927\u5bb6\u597d\uff01\",\"\u041f\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442, \u0446\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u044d\u043a\u043e!\",\"\u0e2a\u0e27\u0e31\u0e2a\u0e14\u0e35\u0e40\u0e2b\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e1c\u0e39\u0e49\u0e0a\u0e37\u0e48\u0e19\u0e0a\u0e2d\u0e1a\u0e40\u0e19\u0e42\u0e01\u0e30!\",\"\u30cd\u30b3\u597d\u304d\u306e\u7686\u3055\u3093\u3001\u3053\u3093\u306b\u3061\u306f\uff01\",\"Ol\u00e1, apreciadores de nekos!\",\"Witajcie, mi\u0142o\u015bnicy neko!\",\"Hej, neko-kendere!\",\"Hallo, neko-kenners!\",\"Hei, neko-fanit!\",\"Hei, neko-kjennere!\",\"Hej, neko-\u00e4lskare!\",\"\u00dcdv, neko-rajong\u00f3k!\",\"Ahoj, milovn\u00edci neko!\",\"Salut, iubitori de neko!\",\"Merhaba neko tutkunlar\u0131!\",\"Ol\u00e1, f\u00e3s de neko!\",\"\u0417\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0439\u0442\u0435, \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u043d\u0435\u043a\u043e!\",\"\u0393\u03b5\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c3\u03b1\u03c2, \u03bb\u03ac\u03c4\u03c1\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03c9\u03bd neko!\",\"\u0645\u0631\u062d\u0628\u064b\u0627 \u064a\u0627 \u0639\u0634\u0651\u0627\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u064a\u0643\u0648!\",\"\u0412\u0456\u0442\u0430\u0454\u043c\u043e, \u0448\u0430\u043d\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u043a\u043e!\",\"\u00a1Hola, fans de las neko!\",\"Xin ch\u00e0o nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u00edch neko!\",null,\"Halo, para penggemar neko!\",\"Helo, peminat neko!\"],\"localized_title_image\":[\"976ef39c73c85cdfb8e847f4cad97c622815d2de.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"976ef39c73c85cdfb8e847f4cad97c622815d2de.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"fe7c44a9a7cb193b6776986bb498d4d305d652a6.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"fe7c44a9a7cb193b6776986bb498d4d305d652a6.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"clone_from_event_gid\":\"681888927386175257\",\"clone_from_sale_enabled\":false}","announcement_body":{"gid":"689773669992366225","clanid":"46268080","posterid":"0","headline":"Mosaique Neko Waifus 6 is out now! \ud83d\udc31","posttime":1794148495,"updatetime":1794148495,"body":"[p]he wait is finally over: [b]Mosaique Neko Waifus 6 is out now on Steam![\/b] Thank you for sticking with us through the delays. We\u2019re excited that you can finally spend time with Niko, Ari, Sayouri, Sara, and Tami.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46268080\/0e0cc70bcd7868549d146e4acebfa42c15dd4252.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p]There are more rotating puzzles to solve, more questionable conversations to have, and more strange items to collect. This time, mana is back, some items can be equipped, and every puzzle has an extra Hard difficulty level.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46268080\/2d58cdd216a801d568a05c7887417a36e3a159c7.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p][\/p][p] Solve a puzzle on Hard and you\u2019ll earn a more valuable item, assuming the nekos don\u2019t distract you first. \ud83d\udc40[\/p][p]Build up your skills, try different combinations of items, and settle in for some cozy puzzle solving.[\/p][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46268080\/0d143036e23e83484aeb1face3c7888f456b975c.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p][\/p][p][url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/4873800\/Mosaique_Neko_Waifus_6\/\"]Play Mosaique Neko Waifus 6 on Steam[\/url].[\/p][p]Thank you again for your patience and support. We hope you have fun! \ud83d\udc96[\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["adult_only_content"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924824838318358","event_gid":"689773669992366224","voteupcount":1,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924824838318358","rtime32_last_modified":1794148762,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":0,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1794146818,"votes_up":1,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"580554131346961272","gidfeature2":"565924824838318358"},{"gid":"689773400962368295","clan_steamid":"103582791475789488","event_name":"Release on November 7th","event_type":28,"appid":4873800,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793837520,"rtime32_end_time":1793840100,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",null,\"\",\"\"],\"localized_summary\":[\"Finally we have the ultimative release date\",\"Endlich steht der endg\u00fcltige Ver\u00f6ffentlichungstermin fest\",\"Nous avons enfin une date de sortie d\u00e9finitive\",\"Finalmente abbiamo una data di uscita definitiva\",\"\ub4dc\ub514\uc5b4 \ucd5c\uc885 \ucd9c\uc2dc\uc77c\uc774 \ud655\uc815\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4\",\"Por fin tenemos la fecha de lanzamiento definitiva\",\"\u7ec8\u4e8e\uff0c\u6700\u7ec8\u53d1\u552e\u65e5\u671f\u786e\u5b9a\u4e86\",\"\u6211\u5011\u7d42\u65bc\u78ba\u5b9a\u4e86\u6700\u7d42\u767c\u552e\u65e5\u671f\",\"\u041d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0446 \u0443 \u043d\u0430\u0441 \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c \u043e\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0447\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0434\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u0432\u044b\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0430\",\"\u0e43\u0e19\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e2a\u0e38\u0e14\u0e40\u0e23\u0e32\u0e01\u0e47\u0e44\u0e14\u0e49\u0e27\u0e31\u0e19\u0e27\u0e32\u0e07\u0e08\u0e33\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e41\u0e19\u0e48\u0e19\u0e2d\u0e19\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27\",\"\u3064\u3044\u306b\u767a\u58f2\u65e5\u304c\u6700\u7d42\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\",\"Finalmente temos uma data de lan\u00e7amento definitiva\",\"Wreszcie znamy ostateczn\u0105 dat\u0119 premiery\",\"Nu har vi endelig den endelige udgivelsesdato\",\"Eindelijk hebben we een definitieve releasedatum\",\"Vihdoin julkaisup\u00e4iv\u00e4 on lopullisesti ly\u00f6ty lukkoon\",\"N\u00e5 er lanseringsdatoen endelig fastsatt\",\"\u00c4ntligen har vi ett slutgiltigt lanseringsdatum\",\"V\u00e9gre megvan a v\u00e9gleges megjelen\u00e9si d\u00e1tum\",\"Kone\u010dn\u011b m\u00e1me definitivn\u00ed datum vyd\u00e1n\u00ed\",\"\u00cen sf\u00e2r\u0219it, avem o dat\u0103 de lansare definitiv\u0103\",\"Sonunda kesin \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f tarihimiz belli oldu\",\"Finalmente temos uma data de lan\u00e7amento definitiva\",\"\u041d\u0430\u0439-\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 \u0438\u043c\u0430\u043c\u0435 \u043e\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0447\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u043d\u0430 \u0434\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0438\u0437\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0430\u043d\u0435\",\"\u0395\u03c0\u03b9\u03c4\u03ad\u03bb\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03ad\u03c7\u03bf\u03c5\u03bc\u03b5 \u03bf\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03b7\u03bc\u03b5\u03c1\u03bf\u03bc\u03b7\u03bd\u03af\u03b1 \u03ba\u03c5\u03ba\u03bb\u03bf\u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1\u03c2\",\"\u0623\u062e\u064a\u0631\u064b\u0627\u060c \u0623\u0635\u0628\u062d \u0644\u062f\u064a\u0646\u0627 \u0645\u0648\u0639\u062f \u0625\u0635\u062f\u0627\u0631 \u0646\u0647\u0627\u0626\u064a\",\"\u041d\u0430\u0440\u0435\u0448\u0442\u0456 \u043c\u0430\u0454\u043c\u043e \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0443 \u0434\u0430\u0442\u0443 \u0432\u0438\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0443\",\"Por fin tenemos la fecha de lanzamiento definitiva\",\"Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng ch\u00fang t\u00f4i c\u0169ng \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ed1t ng\u00e0y ra m\u1eaft\",null,\"Akhirnya, tanggal rilis sudah ditetapkan secara pasti\",\"Akhirnya kami mempunyai tarikh pelancaran yang muktamad\"],\"localized_title_image\":[\"641543138beffeadd9ed522124d1ca59353c29c2.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"11572ebc2feaf56cef81779a99a3b9ad15187193.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"clone_from_event_gid\":\"680760490643686161\",\"clone_from_sale_enabled\":false}","announcement_body":{"gid":"689773400962368296","clanid":"46268080","posterid":"0","headline":"Release on November 7th","posttime":1793837571,"updatetime":1793837571,"body":"[p]First of all, thank you for your patience with us![\/p][p]This time, everything is set, and we\u2019re 100% sure that the release date is final![\/p][p]We\u2019re also packing a punch\u2014the extra development time hasn\u2019t gone to waste. Here\u2019s what\u2019s coming:[\/p][p][b]Mana is making a comeback![\/b] Last seen in Fix-It-Shoppe (2019), it\u2019s back in a big way. We think it makes the game more enjoyable and opens up more possibilities for different playstyles.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46268080\/efae90a21a9d6ab2fbe3a7c80f613ef2ad2d40c7.png\"][\/img][\/p][p][b]Items\u2014some are now equippable![\/b] This change was necessary because, in previous games, you could collect 100 items, all of which added to your stats and threw off the game\u2019s balance.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46268080\/4e793a384f6be3f51e542e038e4f4ada3abab373.png\"][\/img][\/p][p][b]An extra difficulty level![\/b] There\u2019s always been an incentive to replay levels to collect different items, but now each puzzle has an additional difficulty level for even more replay value. Oh, and every puzzle you solve on hard difficulty will reward you with a more valuable item![\/p][p]With each new game, we aim to include more puzzles than the previous game had at launch\u2014and Mosaique Neko Waifus 6 is no exception. We hope you\u2019ll enjoy many hours of fun with the game![\/p]","commentcount":5,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_487176015_1793839369_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924411208748681","event_gid":"689773400962368295","voteupcount":23,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924411208748681","rtime32_last_modified":1794129645,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793839369,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793826737,"votes_up":23,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"580554131346961272","gidfeature2":"565924411208748681"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["689773669992366225","689773400962368296"],"last_update_event":[]}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >It's about time. You can finally reconnect with your favourite cat girl friends.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You meet up with Ari and Niko at the gym. What romantic adventures might follow from this?</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Not the ones you'd expect. You never know with these mischievous cats...</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873800/extras/3e4a4f9b8c258c80be0bdc77f23fbe37.poster.avif?t=1794080863" width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873800/extras/3e4a4f9b8c258c80be0bdc77f23fbe37.mp4?t=1794080863" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Neko Waifus 6 features a soft-incremental progression system: solve puzzles, unlock skills, discover useful (and occasionally questionable) items, and gradually become a neko puzzle-solving machine.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your choices matter - and sometimes come with unexpected rewards. They can lead to different quirky items, each giving you bonuses and helping you tackle puzzles more efficiently. Combine those items with an expanding skill tree to shape how you progress.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873800/extras/32a05d3375e5cdb2f2b6f560df5fd362.poster.avif?t=1794080863" width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873800/extras/32a05d3375e5cdb2f2b6f560df5fd362.mp4?t=1794080863" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Along the way, spend time with your favourite cat girls, see what they've been up to, and collect an assortment of quirky items.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >More puzzles. More progression. More neko girls. More questionable decisions.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >◆ Rotating puzzles - twist, turn, and figure your way through increasingly tricky challenges.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >◆ Choices with rewards - different dialogue choices can lead to different collectible items and bonuses.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >◆ Build your skills - progress through a skill tree that makes solving puzzles faster and more satisfying.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >◆ Soft-incremental progression - your abilities steadily grow as you play, without turning the game into an idle clicker.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >◆ Collect weird stuff - because apparently hanging out with cat girls results in an unusual amount of loot.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >◆ Neko shenanigans - catch up with Ari, Niko, and friends through plenty of silly conversations and unexpected situations.</p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
